  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: BloodSacrifice
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: BloodSacrifice
  Prompt: An odd tree stands out from the rest, exuding a foul smell and looming
    terrifyingly over its neighbors. The roots are stained a filthy mahogony red,
    and an intricate dagger lies buried in the ground nearby
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: Take the blade.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: You all prick your fingers, and gasp as blood surges from the wounds.
        An impossibly thick red flow pours onto the thirsty roots. Now a brilliant
        red, the roots part to reveal a small treasure for you. The old gods reward
        their loyal following.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 8
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 4
        _numMapTiles: 0
      - Type: 9
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 4
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
  - Text: Witchcraft and paganism.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: As you walk away from the tree, you feel an increasing urge to run back
        towards it and beg, stabbing yourself with the knife. The terror suddenly
        subsides, and you're left with feelings of terror and doubt. You have to
        remind yourself - the old gods have no power here, and those who worship
        them are fools.
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
